    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cTouHou Koishi's Enchanted Woods\u300dis a 2.5D pixel action roguelike game. The story centers on the fateful battle between Koishi Komeiji and Hata no Kokoro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/9483af0cf3d48e01d1c5dbd1226d08ed.avif?t=1753271385\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System: A classic and exhilarating bullet-hell shooting game. Take on the role of the powerful Koishi \u00a0and engage in thrilling battles alongside Kokoro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/06e1f69e8c980a7483460f13a0c5c81f.poster.avif?t=1753271385\" width=640 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/06e1f69e8c980a7483460f13a0c5c81f.webm?t=1753271385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Stage Difficulty: During battles, you can enhance or weaken your enemy (Kokoro) through strategic adjustments, creating a customized challenge that allows you to achieve higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/a516605d6fca266e669053963a39a5a7.poster.avif?t=1753271385\" width=640 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/a516605d6fca266e669053963a39a5a7.webm?t=1753271385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive Out-of-Battle Progression: Marisa's Shop offers a wide variety of functional item cards for sale, empowering you to become even stronger in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/e699651c358f69eabecb95fc5d99cbd8.avif?t=1753271385\" width=616 height=268 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports cooperative multiplayer for up to 4 players. Welcome to Gensokyo to experience this thrilling and fun adventure!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cTouHou Koishi's Enchanted Woods\u300dis a 2.5D pixel action roguelike game. The story centers on the fateful battle between Koishi Komeiji and Hata no Kokoro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/9483af0cf3d48e01d1c5dbd1226d08ed.avif?t=1753271385\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System: A classic and exhilarating bullet-hell shooting game. Take on the role of the powerful Koishi \u00a0and engage in thrilling battles alongside Kokoro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/06e1f69e8c980a7483460f13a0c5c81f.poster.avif?t=1753271385\" width=640 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/06e1f69e8c980a7483460f13a0c5c81f.webm?t=1753271385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Stage Difficulty: During battles, you can enhance or weaken your enemy (Kokoro) through strategic adjustments, creating a customized challenge that allows you to achieve higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/a516605d6fca266e669053963a39a5a7.poster.avif?t=1753271385\" width=640 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/a516605d6fca266e669053963a39a5a7.webm?t=1753271385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive Out-of-Battle Progression: Marisa's Shop offers a wide variety of functional item cards for sale, empowering you to become even stronger in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480330/extras/e699651c358f69eabecb95fc5d99cbd8.avif?t=1753271385\" width=616 height=268 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports cooperative multiplayer for up to 4 players. Welcome to Gensokyo to experience this thrilling and fun adventure!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u300cTouHou Koishi's Enchanted Woods\u300d is a Touhou fangame.This is a &quot;reverse-construction&quot; action rogue-lite.Koishi vs. Kokoro! But as the playable character, Koishi uses various enhancement cards to continuously strengthen Kokoro. Can she ultimately defeat the Kokoro she has built up herself?",
